infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two silent erosion paths of vendor-neutrality
  desc Emitting OTLP is necessary but not sufficient — lock-in hides either in app code (vendor SDK) or in the Collector config (proprietary processor)
  compares
    - label Vendor SDK in app code
      children
        - label Where: in application code
          desc dd-trace / New Relic SDK at the app boundary
        - label Migration: rewrite code
          desc Re-instrument every service, not one config
        - label Audit: grep the app code
          desc Find vendor-SDK imports like dd-trace
    - label Proprietary Collector processors
      children
        - label Where: in the Collector config
          desc A processor only vendor-X's distro ships
        - label Migration: rewrite the processor
          desc No upstream equivalent to move to vendor-Y
        - label Audit: inventory Collector YAML
          desc Processor names that exist in one distro only
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b
